 12→ * Receives Sentry issue/alert events via internal integration webhook.
 13→ * Creates GitHub issues with `auto-fix` label to trigger the auto-fix pipeline.
 14→ *
 15→ * Handles three resource types:
 16→ * - `issue` — direct issue subscription (created, regression)
 17→ * - `event_alert` — alert rule triggers
 18→ * - `installation` — integration lifecycle
 19→ *
 20→ * Also accepts settings validation requests (no resource header)
 21→ * needed for Sentry alert-rule-action schema validation.
